msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-science/quantum-teleportation/extracted-outputs/7d7742fa-e9a2-4ca0-9d9b-f29d73e07cd9-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
